category: Libs
requires: cygwin
sdesc: "Library to create, extract, and modify Windows Imaging files (runtime)"
ldesc: "wimlib is a C library for creating, modifying, extracting, and mounting
Windows Imaging (WIM) files. wimlib and its command-line frontend
'wimlib-imagex' provide a free and cross-platform alternative to Microsoft's
WIMGAPI, ImageX, and DISM."
external-source: wimlib

